# Muslinx Linux Kernel Configuration
# This file is auto-generated by scripts/04-build-kernel.sh on first run.
# To customize, edit this file and re-run the kernel build script.
#
# Base: x86_64 defconfig + Muslinx additions
# See MUSLINX_BUILD_PLAN.md Phase 4 for details on enabled options.
#
# Key features enabled:
#   - EFI + EFI Stub boot
#   - SquashFS + OverlayFS (live ISO)
#   - DRM/KMS: VirtIO GPU, Bochs, i915, AMDGPU, Nouveau
#   - VirtIO: PCI, Net, Block, Console, SCSI
#   - Input: evdev, USB HID
#   - Audio: HDA Intel
#   - Filesystems: ext4, vfat, tmpfs, fuse
#   - devtmpfs auto-mount
